11.	Say to @wPN{Enlil-massu}  
12.	what @wPN{Inim-Inana} says: 

{3 = 3-15}
33.	They told me everything and I am pleased beyond exaggeration. 
34.	May the precious protective power of a lifetime; 
35.	@wPN{Lugal-šu}, @wPN{Nabi-Enlil} and @wPN{Enlil-alsag}, the scholars who precede you; 
36.	and @wDN{Ninimma}, your own goddess, 
37.	and @wDN{Nisaba}, 
38.	the lady of broad wisdom, 
39.	give wisdom to you. 
310.	You did not know what was written on the tablet or that the city would be unforthcoming. 
311.	@wPN{Lu-gena} is sending you two shekels of silver, 
312.	one garment and two sashes. 
313.	Accept them. 
314.	But your mother should not touch the remaining assets. 
315.	It is urgent. 
